Alembic migrations for the Relayna Studio PostgreSQL control-plane database.

Create future revisions from studio/backend with:

    RELAYNA_STUDIO_DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://... uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"

Review every generated operation before committing it. Deployments run
`alembic upgrade head` as a separate maintenance step before starting the new
Studio backend image; the application never mutates its schema at startup.
